# The frontend image is the only build that uses the repo root as its context
# (docker-compose.yml, e2e.yml, demo-smoke.yml and publish-images.yml all pass
# context "." with frontend/Dockerfile); the backend build uses backend/ as its
# context and has its own backend/.dockerignore. A .dockerignore only applies
# at the context root, so this file replaces the never-effective
# frontend/.dockerignore.
#
# Keep host-installed/generated trees out of the context: they are recreated
# inside the image, and since the pnpm migration (#653) frontend/node_modules
# is a symlink tree into a user-wide hardlink store that must never be copied
# into an image.
**/node_modules
frontend/dist
backend/build
backend/.gradle
e2e/test-results
e2e/playwright-report
.git
.env*
**/*.md
